  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12 mins. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66b5bd911b6b624b5797b109-8c72ff9b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into rounds. Trim and roughly chop green beans.\n• Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• In a medium heatproof bowl, combine peanut butter and the boiling water(1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P), whisking until smooth. Add sweet chilli sauce, hoisin sauce, the soy sauce and vinegar and mix to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66b5bd911b6b624b5797b109-3caec887.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan with a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook tofu, turning until browned, 3-4 mins. Transfer to a bowl. Cook tofu in batches for the best results.\n• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook carrot and green beans, tossing, until tender, 3-4 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66b5bd911b6b624b5797b109-c70ef318.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Remove pan from heat, then add peanut sauce mixture. Toss until well combined. Season to taste.\n• Divide rice between bowls. Top with sweet chilli-peanut tofu and green beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66b5bd911b6b624b5797b109-4a027f61.jpeg"
    }
  ]
